    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.0": "§7Prints §fwafer packages§7 through a §freticle§7 (not consumed).",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.1": "§bPrime §8> §bcoat §8> §bbake §8> §dexpose §8> §bbake §8> §bdevelop §8> §brinse",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.2": "§aBuilt-in filter units: no Cleanroom needed.",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.3": "§eFive UV modes§7, each on its own substrate:",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.4": " §dMUV§7 350nm Silicon  §9HUV§7 250nm Phosphorus",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.5": " §bEUV§7 200nm Naquadah  §aXUV§7 100nm / §6LUV§7 50nm Neutronium",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.6": "§7Light: §dMUV§7 mercury i-line, §9HUV§7/§bEUV§7 §fKrF excimer laser§7,",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.7": " §aXUV§7 §fArF excimer laser§7, §6LUV§7 §fArF immersion§7 (water film).",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.8": "§7Lasers burn §fexcimer gas§7. The resist must match the light.",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.9": "§7Finer: §c4A next tier§7, §61.5x chemicals§7, §adenser, more dies§7.",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.10": "§7Better substrates print §fmore packages§7 per run (up to 16).",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.11": "§7Power: §fexactly 2 Energy Hatches§7, 4A of the mode's tier.",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.12": "§7Needs §f1 Maintenance§7, §f1+ Fluid Input§7, buses at the controller.",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.13": "§7HV-LuV circuits need chips from §9HUV§7-§6LUV§7. §aPerfect OC§7.",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.14": "§6LUV§7 also grows a §fhigh-k gate§7: needs §fHafnium Tetrachloride§7.",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.15": "§6Versions 1-5§7, like the Assembly Line: one more lens slice each (3-7),",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.16": " §7Light source allows up to: §fpurple lamp§7 V1, §fKrF laser§7 V3, §fArF laser§7 V5.",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.17": "§7A version runs the modes up to its own. Per version above a mode:",
    "af9.photolithography_line.tooltip.18": " §a0.8x time§7, §a+20%% bonus-package chance§7, §a+10%% transistors§7.",
